                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Do you want a difficult video game?  Well this is it.  Very difficult but fair.  The gameplay tends to get repetative but overall a solid experience.  Music is really good.  Nice metal tracks that really amp up your experience.  Famous monsters like Medusa make an appearance here.\n\nYou will die multiple times playing this game the first time.  Good luck on beating it I may have given up already.  The starting pistol is terrible and game likes to respawn you right on top of enemies after deaths.\n\nIf you would like a more comprehensive review feel free to watch this video and see some gameplay for yourself:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vM-xJO9Og68&feature=youtu.be",
